    <button id="expandAll">展开全部</button>
    <button id="collapseAll">收起全部</button>
    <button id="exportBtn">导出进度</button>
    <button id="importBtn">导入进度</button>
    <button id="resetBtn">清空全部</button>
    <input type="file" id="importFile" accept=".json" style="display:none" />
    <span id="saved" class="saved"></span>
    <span class="memnote">记忆：进度自动存于<b>本浏览器</b> · <b>每位访客进度独立</b>（互不干扰）· 换设备用「导出/导入」迁移</span>
  </div>
  <div class="filters" id="filters"></div>
  <div class="legend">
    <span><b>军事</b>=Military(满级) · <b>特殊</b>=Special · <b>金</b>=Gold · <b>铂金</b>=Platinum · <b>谐波破碎</b>=Harmonic Break · <b>分歧</b>=Divergence（迷彩名格式：中文(英文原名)）</span>
